# Optional Playwright auth happy path (copy to .env.e2e — gitignored).
# E2E_EMAIL="creator@example.com"
# E2E_PASSWORD="your-local-test-password"
#
# Loading gallery (`e2e/loading.spec.ts` → `/e2e/loadings`):
# Requires E2E_LOADING_GALLERY=1 AND non-production (never on Vercel production).
# Playwright webServer sets the flag when it starts `npm run dev`.
# If you reuse an already-running dev server, export E2E_LOADING_GALLERY=1 there too.
